{'symbol': 'DXC', 'date': '2019-10-10 22:30:00', 'title': 'DXC TECHNOLOGY COMPANY DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND FOR THE QUARTER ENDING SEPTEMBER 30, 2019, PAYABLE ON JANUARY 14, 2020', 'text': "THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF DXC TECHNOLOGY DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT FOR THE QUARTER ENDING SEPTEMBER 30, 2019 OF $0.21 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND WILL BE PAID ON JANUARY 14, 2020 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON DECEMBER 4, 2019."}